{
  "name": "Qwen Image 2.1 Reference",
  "description": "Up to 16 reference images with independent output dimensions. Use Qwen Image 2.1 diffusion, Qwen3-VL 8B conditioning encoder (not a PE prompt enhancer), and Qwen Image 2.1 VAE.",
  "defaults": {
    "width": 1024,
    "height": 1024,
    "steps": 25,
    "cfg": 1,
    "sampler_name": "euler",
    "scheduler": "simple",
    "batch_size": 1,
    "negative_prompt": ""
  },
  "notes": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Qwen Image 2.1 model selection",
      "content": "The reference workflow uses qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors diffusion, qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors conditioning encoder, and qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors. Select matching installed models in the parameter sheet. Models containing pe_i2i or pe_t2i are prompt enhancers, not the conditioning encoder. Sampling follows the reference workflow: QwenImage21Cache auto/default, Euler/simple, 25 steps, CFG 1. Reference encoding resolution is 1024. The independent EmptyLatentImage determines output dimensions; the encoder's reference-sized latent is intentionally unused."
    }
  ],
